This product contains code and design derived from the following
Apache-2.0 licensed projects:

  Tianshu-harness (https://github.com/huiliyi37/Tianshu-harness)
  Copyright (c) Tianshu-harness contributors
  Derived works:
    - lib/policy.js
        `protection = hitRate × (1 − pressure)` and the prune-deferral rule
        (from src/cache/advisor.ts `shouldDelayCompact`), the three ratio
        profiles `cache-preserving` / `balanced` / `aggressive` and the
        `adaptiveCompactPolicyRatios` adjustment (from
        src/compact/constants.ts), the `precisionCeilingRatio` idea (same
        file), the `SessionWarmthTracker` cold/warm/hot prediction (from
        src/cache/session-warmth.ts), and DeepSeek peak/off-peak phase
        arithmetic (from src/utils/pricing-phase.ts).
    - lib/prune.js
        The in-place-only pruning rule and the three-rule semantic prune
        (from src/compact/semantic-prune.ts), and the `redundant` /
        `expired` / `useless` AgentDiet classification (from
        src/compact/agent-diet.ts).
    - lib/audit.js
        The dual hit-rate accounting idea (from src/cache/billed-hit-rate.ts)
        and the cache-monotonicity diagnostic (from src/prompt/cache-diagnostic.ts).

  dsh-headroom (https://github.com/giter00/dsh-headroom)
  Copyright (c) dsh-headroom contributors
  Derived works:
    - lib/fold.js
        The content-router shape (`json-pivot`, `search-fold`, `log-fold`,
        `tabular-fold`, shell summary, head/tail truncation) and the
        `noFoldForTools` / `noFoldForPatterns` byte-contract guards.
    - lib/ccr.js
        The content-addressed reversible store with TTL, entry cap, and
        debounced atomic writes.
    - lib/index.js
        The `tools/post-execute` listener shape and `defineTool` registration
        pattern.

No code was copied verbatim from the projects above; the derivations are
re-implementations of their published mechanisms, with the algorithms and
threshold values preserved so the behaviour can be compared.
